{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="site-page">
  <h1>How It Works</h1>
  <p>Welcome to Research Roomies! We connect researchers traveling to the same conferences to help you share accommodation and save costs.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 1.5rem" id="create-post">Creating a Post</h2>
  <p>To find a roomie, you can <a href="/create">create a post</a> indicating the conference you are attending, whether you already have a booked room or are looking for one, and specific preferences.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 1.5rem" id="respond-post">Responding to a Post</h2>
  <p>If you see a post from someone you would like to room with, you must fall under their required parameters (if any). You can send them a message directly through our platform via the "Contact" button on their post page. Afterwards, it is up to both of you to determine housing arrangements safely!</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 1.5rem" id="edit-post">Editing or Removing a Post</h2>
  <p>Once you've made a post, you can view your posts and remove them at any time from your account by logging in and managing your active requests.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 1.5rem" id="report-post">Reporting a Post</h2>
  <p>If you find a post that seems fraudulent, violates our terms of service, or poses a safety risk, you can notify us at <a href="mailto:admin@researchroomies.com">admin@researchroomies.com</a>. We take our community's safety seriously and will review the report immediately.</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
